Package: SigBridgeR
Title: Integrative Toolkit for Linking Phenotypes to Cell Subpopulations via scRNA-seq and Bulk Data
Version: 3.5.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
        person("Yuxi", "Yang", email = "15364051195@163.com", role = c("cre", "aut"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-1329-1224")),
